<title>PHILIPPINES: Eleven die in Philippine bus crash.</title>
<headline>Eleven die in Philippine bus crash.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eleven people died and 13 were injured on Tuesday when a speeding passenger bus crashed into the railing of a bridge on Masbate island in the central Philippines, police said.</p>
<p>A police report said the driver lost control when one of the tyres of his vehicle burst as he was trying to overtake another bus.</p>
